    "name": "Nothing But Road",
    "steam_appid": 3858260,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nothing But Road</strong> is a cozy post-apocalyptic road trip with light survival elements and a soul.<br>There are no enemies. No zombies. No bandits. Just you, your car, and the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858260/extras/0e609760032d6478c010ecf6d379ce7c.poster.avif?t=1755093077\" width=616 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858260/extras/0e609760032d6478c010ecf6d379ce7c.webm?t=1755093077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858260/extras/0e609760032d6478c010ecf6d379ce7c.mp4?t=1755093077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore procedurally generated wilderness segments between story-rich destinations. Loot abandoned cabins, repair your vehicle, upgrade it with survival modules, and keep moving forward \u2014 because something dark is slowly catching up behind you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your car is your lifeline</strong> \u2014 your best friend. Equip it with extra fuel tanks, storage units, food preservation tools, and tracking devices to help you scavenge deeper into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858260/extras/cde801883fa48c08c892474de49eaf50.poster.avif?t=1755093077\" width=616 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858260/extras/cde801883fa48c08c892474de49eaf50.webm?t=1755093077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858260/extras/cde801883fa48c08c892474de49eaf50.mp4?t=1755093077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric third-person exploration with stylized low-poly visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gentle yet emotional solo journey about hope and isolation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Partial open world: freedom to explore each zone before driving onward</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A light crafting system and satisfying loot mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode (approx. 5+ hours planned) and Endless Infinity Mode with unique content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat. Just survival, exploration, and your bond with the road.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858260/extras/b69672dacf815595b0491005d5deea8c.poster.avif?t=1755093077\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858260/extras/b69672dacf815595b0491005d5deea8c.webm?t=1755093077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858260/extras/b69672dacf815595b0491005d5deea8c.mp4?t=1755093077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a fan of slow-paced survival, cozy indies, or reflective adventures \u2014 this is a game made to be felt, not rushed.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nothing But Road</strong> is a cozy post-apocalyptic road trip with light survival elements and a soul.<br>There are no enemies. No zombies. No bandits. Just you, your car, and the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858260/extras/0e609760032d6478c010ecf6d379ce7c.poster.avif?t=1755093077\" width=616 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858260/extras/0e609760032d6478c010ecf6d379ce7c.webm?t=1755093077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858260/extras/0e609760032d6478c010ecf6d379ce7c.mp4?t=1755093077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore procedurally generated wilderness segments between story-rich destinations. Loot abandoned cabins, repair your vehicle, upgrade it with survival modules, and keep moving forward \u2014 because something dark is slowly catching up behind you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your car is your lifeline</strong> \u2014 your best friend. Equip it with extra fuel tanks, storage units, food preservation tools, and tracking devices to help you scavenge deeper into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858260/extras/cde801883fa48c08c892474de49eaf50.poster.avif?t=1755093077\" width=616 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858260/extras/cde801883fa48c08c892474de49eaf50.webm?t=1755093077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858260/extras/cde801883fa48c08c892474de49eaf50.mp4?t=1755093077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric third-person exploration with stylized low-poly visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gentle yet emotional solo journey about hope and isolation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Partial open world: freedom to explore each zone before driving onward</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A light crafting system and satisfying loot mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode (approx. 5+ hours planned) and Endless Infinity Mode with unique content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No combat. Just survival, exploration, and your bond with the road.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858260/extras/b69672dacf815595b0491005d5deea8c.poster.avif?t=1755093077\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858260/extras/b69672dacf815595b0491005d5deea8c.webm?t=1755093077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3858260/extras/b69672dacf815595b0491005d5deea8c.mp4?t=1755093077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a fan of slow-paced survival, cozy indies, or reflective adventures \u2014 this is a game made to be felt, not rushed.</p>",
